<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EMC started outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EMC started outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Wednesday it started coverage of EMC Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings estimates at $2.05 per share for 1997 and $2.60 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Set target price of $55 per share, or 21-times 1998 estimate.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/16 to 47-9/16.</p>
</text>
